{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"观念"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"Morita 等价"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"Morita等价(观念)"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>本页介绍广义的 Morita 等价观念. 关于环的 Morita 等价, 见 "},{"Local":{"url":"Morita等价","text":"Morita 等价"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"语法–语义对偶","text":"语法"}},{"Plain":"对象的 Morita 等价是它们的语义之间的等价.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>环之间的 Morita 等价是它们的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数上的模","text":"模范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的等价. (这是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Morita等价","text":"Morita 等价"}},{"Plain":"的原义.)</li>\n<li>范畴之间的 Morita 等价是它们的"},{"Local":{"url":"预层意象","text":"预层范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的等价.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"景","text":"景"}},{"Plain":"之间的 Morita 等价是它们"},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"之间的等价.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}